0,Mixtec languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mixtec_language,"January 18, 2026 - One of the most characteristic features of Mixtec is its use of tones, a characteristic it shares with all other Otomanguean languages. Despite its importance in the language, the tonal analyses of Mixtec have been many and quite different one from another. Some varieties of Mixtec display ...","Mixtec, Alacatlatzala",Otomanguean
