8,A Mixtec Sound Change Database | Journal of Open Humanities Data,https://openhumanitiesdata.metajnl.com/articles/10.5334/johd.184,"March 13, 2024 - We exemplify this with proto-Mixtec *s. Modern reflexes of this sound include no change (i.e. retention of /s/), loss, and fricatives /ð/, /ʃ/, and /h/. Three varieties (Alacatlatzala, Cahuatache, and San Luis Morelia Mixtec) retain /s/ unchanged in all environments.","Mixtec, Alacatlatzala",Otomanguean
